# Target C — a fully ported single-chart collar forces nonunit loaded sides

```text
one actual chart for the entire unloaded component + a port at every loaded vertex
 -> k <= 2 and q <= 2 m_B + O(D^(2/3) + D epsilon + 1)
 -> exclude the zero/one-nonunit-side collar as epsilon -> 0
 -> a general C-II closure still needs a chart theorem or a finite competitor
    for the surviving linear family of nonunit sides.
```

